	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(40.0, 15.0, 320.0, 52.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 1: AUDIT KUALITAS AWAL (3.807 baris)
Cek missing, rentang tanggal 2012-2026 &amp; platform.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(233.0, 331.0, 215.0, 60.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 2: FILTER OFF-TOPIC
tanggal &gt;= 2026-01-01
(Buang 1.276 data 2012-2024)</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(435.0, 125.0, 225.0, 78.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 3: CLEANING &amp; TRANSFORMASI
Deduplikasi, buang fragmen berita,
HTML/NFKC, case folding, kamus slang
&amp; stopwords -&gt; teks_bersih, jumlah_kata</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(655.0, 345.0, 195.0, 58.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 4: FILTER KOSONG
jumlah_kata &gt;= 1
(Buang 31 baris -&gt; 2.492 final)</text>
		<text id="4" type="text/plain" rect="(870.0, 15.0, 240.0, 52.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 5: VERIFIKASI &amp; EKSPOR
Bandingkan hasil sebelum vs sesudah
dan ekspor data_bersih.csv</text>
	</annotations>
